# V1.0 Videokonferenzen, Wave 2 "Aufzeichnung" -- the egress container's raw per-track output sink
# (docker-compose.yml's `egress` service bind-mounts this directory to /out; the Ktor server reads
# the same bytes back from here via LAPIS_EGRESS_OUTPUT_HOST_DIR, see ConferenceRecordingConfig
# KDoc). Real recorded audio/video of real participants must never be committed to this repository.
egress-out/
